{title: Zindagi Di Paudi}
{artist: Millind Gaba}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m] Zindagi Di Paudi Jithe Tak Chadhange,        Tere [G#] Naal Chadaange
[C#m] Sukh Hove Dukh Hove Dhunp Chaanv,        Tere [G#] Naal Khadaange
[F#] Me Ohna Cho Nhi Jo Waada Krde,        Nayi Poora Wich [G#] Dol Jaande Ne
[F#] Me Ohda Cho Nhi Jo Bohte Bandey Ne,        Sachhe [G#] Jhuth Bol Jande Ne
[F#] Jithe V Rahenge Khushi He Rahaange,        [D#m] Dukh Aya Koyi Ohde [G#] Naal Ladaange
[C#m] Zindagi Di Paudi Jithe Tak Chadhange,        Tere [G#] Naal Chadhaange
[C#m] Sukh Hove Dukh Hove Dhoop Chaaw,        Tere [G#] Naal Khadhange
[C#] Mehal Da Waada Nai Krda Me,        [F#] Ek Chota Ja [G#] Ghar Hona
Oh? [C#] Mehal Da Waada Nai Karda Me,        [F#] Ek Chota Ja [G#] Ghar Hona
[C#] Laakh Croran Nai Judne Ne,        [F#] Hazaaran Wich He [G#] Sir Hona
[F#] Main Ohna Cho Nhi Jo Tennu Pon Layi,        Waade-Waade [G#] Khwaab Dikhaaye
[F#] Main Ohna Cho Nhi Jo Tennu Pon Layi,        Ambraan To [G#] Taare Laaike Aye
[F#] Ohna He Kahunga Jinna Kr Sakunga,        [D#m] Tere Naal Jeena Tere [G#] Naal Marange
[C#m] Jindagi Di Paudi Jithe Tak Chadhange,        Tere [G#] Naal Chadhaange
[C#m] Sukh Hovein Dukh Hovein Dhoop Chaaw,        Tere [G#] Naal Khadhaange
[C#] Aadat Pai Ju Hassan Di Tainu,        [F#] Ankh Chon Hanju [G#] Nai Tu Chona
[C#] Khush Rakhunga Ainna Tainu,        [F#] Bhool Jaana Eh [G#] Tu Rona
[F#] Me Ohna Chon Nai Jo Haath Fadke,        Kisse Da Fir [G#] Piche Ho Jayi
[F#] Me Ohna Chon Nai Jo Neend Kise Di Udaake,        Chain [G#] Naal So Jaye
[F#] Ban Meri Jaan Deewaana Nirman,        [D#m] Pyar Ton Wadh Tainu [G#] Pyar Karaange
[C#m] Zindagi Di Paudi Jithe Tak Chadange,        Tere [G#] Naal Chadange
[C#m] Sukh Hove Dukh Hove Dhup Chaanv,        Tere [G#] Naal Khadhange
